  PDFRender - JPEG 2000 decode wrapper around the vendored OpenJPEG.

  OpenJPEG hands back planar, possibly subsampled, possibly signed
  component arrays of arbitrary precision; this turns that into the
  flat XRGB32 buffer the rest of PDFRender uses.  All OpenJPEG error
  and warning callbacks are swallowed - a broken image must never
  print to the CLI from inside a module.

